  "rule": "Call Buy only once spot is above BOTH the first-15-minute opening-range high (09:15-09:30) AND the day's CPR Top Central (TC). Put Buy only once spot is below BOTH the OR-15 low AND CPR Bottom Central (BC). Otherwise flat. CPR TC/BC = Pivot=(H+L+C)/3, BC=(H+L)/2, TC=2*Pivot-BC from the PREVIOUS day's completed OHLC. 1 lot of the ATM strike (CE/PE, always bought, never written). Pure reversal exit: an opposite-condition tick closes and reopens immediately, no debounce, no target/stop-loss. Forced close at the last snapshot of the day (EOD). Entries only 09:16-15:14 IST and only once the opening range has closed (09:30).",
